WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:04.000
A model shows her natural parting and crown.

00:04.000 --> 00:08.000
She holds up a wavy hair topper.

00:08.000 --> 00:10.000
She turns the base to show its attachment clips.

00:10.000 --> 00:14.000
She places the topper and blends it with her own hair.

00:14.000 --> 00:16.500
She smiles and shows the finished look.
